You are working on the Comlabs codebase. Follow COMLABS_BLUEPRINT.md for product and visual direction.

Implementation rules:
- Strict TypeScript; explicit types for props and public APIs.
- Prefer named exports; kebab-case for filenames and directories.
- Use `"use client"` only at the lowest interactive leaf.
- Spacing: 4px base — only multiples of 4 (gap-4, p-6, etc.).
- Typography: Inter; tracking-tight globally; display uses font-medium only — never font-semibold or font-bold.
- Color: monochromatic tokens from CSS variables (--bg-*, --fg-*, --border*). No purple/blue accents on backgrounds; gradients only on primary CTAs per blueprint.
- Motion: Framer Motion with ease [0.25, 0.1, 0, 1]; motion communicates state, not decoration.
- Light theme only; use CSS variables (--bg-*, --fg-*, --border*).
